From 0c1472ae599840932e5f25a4f32354eec0a9c83f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Work Leaf Bench <bench@example.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 16:07:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD review completion prompts so users can close finished
 patch chats

After a clean review, WorkLeafController records the reviewed commit, appends a repeatable feature-done prompt to the patch-agent transcript, and selects that chat. The terminal treats yes/y as a UI close without sending it to the agent, while follow-up typing reopens the hidden patch chat so additional polish stays attached to the same agent.
